  "transcription": "Add MS a 94 $^{18(94)}$ (94) (2)\n\n(1.13). $\\left(1+2x+2x^4+2x^9+\\cdots\\right)^6$\n$= 1 - 4\\left(\\frac{1^2 x}{1-x} - \\frac{3^2 x^3}{1-x^3} + \\frac{5^2 x^5}{1-x^5} - \\cdots\\right)$\n$+ 16\\left(\\frac{1^2 x}{1+x^2} + \\frac{2^2 x^2}{1+x^4} + \\frac{3^2 x^3}{1+x^6} + \\cdots\\right).$\n(1.14) $\\left(1+2x+2x^4+2x^9+\\cdots\\right)^8$\n$= 1 + 16\\left(\\frac{1^3 x}{1+x} + \\frac{2^3 x^2}{1-x^2} + \\frac{3^3 x^3}{1+x^3} + \\cdots\\right).$\n(1.21) $\\frac{\\left(1\\pm 2x+2x^4\\pm 2x^9+\\cdots\\right)^3}{1\\pm 2x^3+2x^{12}\\pm 2x^{27}+\\cdots}$\n$= 1 \\pm 6\\left(\\frac{x}{1+x} - \\frac{x^2}{1+x^2} + \\frac{x^4}{1+x^4} - \\frac{x^5}{1+x^5} + \\cdots\\right)$\n(1.22) $\\frac{\\left(1+2x^3+2x^{12}+2x^{27}+\\cdots\\right)^3}{1+2x+2x^4+2x^9+\\cdots}$\n$= 1 - 2\\left(\\frac{x}{1+x} - \\frac{x^2}{1-x^2} + \\frac{x^4}{1-x^4} - \\frac{x^5}{1+x^5} + \\cdots\\right)$\n(1.31) $\\frac{\\left(1+x+x^3+x^6+x^{10}+\\cdots\\right)^3}{1+x^3+x^9+x^{18}+x^{30}+\\cdots}$\n$= 1 + 3\\left(\\frac{x}{1-x} - \\frac{x^5}{1-x^5} + \\frac{x^7}{1-x^7} - \\cdots\\right)$\n(1.32). $\\frac{x\\left(1+x^3+x^9+x^{18}+x^{30}+\\cdots\\right)^3}{1+x+x^3+x^6+x^{10}+\\cdots}$\n$= \\frac{x}{1-x^2} - \\frac{x^2}{1-x^4} + \\frac{x^4}{1-x^8} - \\frac{x^5}{1-x^{10}} + \\cdots$\n(1.41). $\\frac{(1-x)^3(1-x^2)^3(1-x^3)^3(1-x^4)^3\\cdots}{(1-x^3)(1-x^6)(1-x^9)(1-x^{12})\\cdots}$\n$= 1 - 3\\left(\\frac{x}{1-x} - \\frac{x^2}{1-x^2} + \\frac{x^4}{1-x^4} - \\frac{x^5}{1-x^5} + \\cdots\\right) +$",
